New in this Release
-------------------

This is the first alpha release for the phyCORE-AM67x. The following interfaces are currently working:

* SD-Card
* eMMC
* RTC
* EEPROM
* I2C
* Ethernet
* USB 2.0
* USB 3.0
* PCIe
